B.a9W=new A.jk("no-sus-chat","NO SUS Chat","A chat with yourself for notes, links and files, kept in your own Google Drive.",B.ab6,B.agU,B.aom)
B.a9e=new A.d2("How","On the other screen, open nosus.foo/go. On your phone, open Chat, tap Open on any screen and scan the QR it shows. Match the number, then choose what that screen can open.",!1)
B.a9I=new A.d2("Your account stays on your phone","The other screen only gets the items you approve, and only while the session is open.",!1)
B.a9s=new A.d2("After the session","Ending the session stops that screen from opening anything else. Files you downloaded or printed there can stay on it, so use a screen you trust.",!0)
