B.a9v=new A.d2("Watermarks","Your email and the time are drawn over every page you open. A photo of the screen carries them too, so a leaked page points back to who opened it.",!1)
B.a91=new A.d2("Screenshot blocking is Android-only","On Android the app blocks screenshots and screen recording, and records the attempt. On the web and on iOS nothing can stop a screenshot. There, the watermark and the activity log protect you.",!0)
B.a98=new A.d2("A camera always wins","No app can stop someone photographing their screen with another phone. These controls tell you who, after the fact.",!0)
B.ajJ=s([B.a9v,B.a91,B.a98],t.eH)
