B.aaS=new A.b0(62005,"MaterialIcons",!1)
B.a9u=new A.d2("What you can hear about","Invites and join requests, role changes, admin actions that affect you, files added to your groups, and security alerts. Turn each one off in Settings \u2192 Notifications.",!1)
B.a9F=new A.d2("Nothing sensitive on the lock screen","A notification names the group and what kind of thing happened, never a file\u2019s name or what it says.",!1)
B.a9a=new A.d2("If you said no to the permission","Android asks once. Everything still shows under the bell in the app, and Settings \u2192 Notifications has a button to open the system setting.",!1)
